corpus/lm-v1/**/source-role.json
corpus/lm-v1/**/approved-colloquial.json
base/**
!base/README.md
sft/**
!sft/README.md

# Formal training runs (checkpoints / logs)
training/runs/**
!training/runs/.gitkeep


